<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main>
<div class="quality-stamp">
    <div class="stamp">INSPECTED*</div>
    <p>At Large Motors, every vehicle on our lot meets our rigorous internal standard for
      being, at minimum, a car. We stand firmly behind everything we sell, mostly because
      it's parked on a slight decline and the wheel blocks are extra. Quality isn't just
      a word to us — it's a word we put on the sign out front.</p>
  </div>
   <h2 class="section-title" id="quality">Our Quality Promise</h2>
  <p style="max-width:700px; line-height:1.6; color:#d8cfb8;">
    We know what you've heard about used car lots, and frankly, it's hurtful. Every vehicle
    on our lot is thoroughly looked at, sometimes by a professional, before it's parked out
    front with the hood propped open just enough to look inspected. We do not sell cars that
    fall apart in a few weeks due to poor maintenance — we sell cars that fall apart on
    whatever timeline they were already going to fall apart on, which is a completely
    different and much more honest thing.
  </p>

  <h2 class="section-title" id="testimonials">What Our Customers Say</h2>
  <div class="testimonials">
    <div class="testimonial">
      "It started every day for almost two weeks. I have never felt so seen by a business."
      <cite>— D. Okafor, satisfied driveway owner</cite>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonial">
