  <h2 class="section-title" id="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <div class="faq">
    <details>
      <summary>Do your cars come with a warranty?</summary>
      <p>Every vehicle comes with our exclusive Large Motors Confidence Window, which lasts
        from the moment you sign the paperwork until you leave the lot. After that, we
        believe in you.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Why is there a suspicious puddle under most of your inventory?</summary>
      <p>That's condensation. It's a very humid lot. We've discussed this with our
        mechanic and he agrees it's probably fine.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can I get a car inspected before I buy it?</summary>
      <p>Absolutely, as long as your inspector doesn't mind us standing directly behind
        them the entire time, offering context.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>What does "OBO" mean on your price tags?</summary>
      <p>Or Better Offer. We are always listening, especially to offers that are better.</p>
    </details>
  </div>

